{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a heart-pumping, <strong>extraction-based PvPvE</strong> adventure set in a vast, post-apocalyptic world. Scavenge for resources and unleash your creativity with a revolutionary crafting system that lets you combine any objects using tape, creating one-of-a-kind, game-changing weapons. Team up with friends to explore expansive locations, overcome treacherous terrain, and take down both AI and human opponents in intense battles. Extract valuable loot to upgrade your base, enhance your arsenal, and gain a competitive edge in this unforgiving world. Will you survive and thrive in <strong>REQUISITION VR</strong>? The challenge awaits.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique crafting mechanics</strong> allow players to combine almost any items they come across in the environment, enabling them to create weapons on the go. These mechanics have been improved in the Meta Quest version of the game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental traps</strong> are scattered across large, open locations. These traps, when triggered, can attract hordes of zombies, so players must be cautious to avoid being overwhelmed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural barricades and locks</strong> force players to find creative ways to enter houses, which may have boarded-up windows or locked doors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse enemies:</strong> Each zombie type has distinct behaviors and resistances. Armored zombies are tough against firearms, while spiked zombies are best dealt with using long-range weapons to avoid close combat.<br><br></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4109600?t=1761342491","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4109600?t=1761342491","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.