 traps</strong> are scattered across large, open locations. These traps, when triggered, can attract hordes of zombies, so players must be cautious to avoid being overwhelmed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural barricades and locks</strong> force players to find creative ways to enter houses, which may have boarded-up windows or locked doors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse enemies:</strong> Each zombie type has distinct behaviors and resistances. Armored zombies are tough against firearms, while spiked zombies are best dealt with using long-range weapons to avoid close combat.<br><br></p></li></ul>","developers":["Spheroom"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109600/e6708117d0eee799e07bb700d3405ab936f35e5a/header.jpg?t=1761342491","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4109600/528913757/ea9f5b003dd9aff69f2243cf18cd8980201578ca/1760808818/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760809935","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4109600/528913757/ea9f5b003dd9aff69f2243cf18cd8980201578ca/1760808818/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760809935","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4109600/528913757/ea9f5b003dd9aff69f2243cf18cd8980201578ca/1760808818/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760809935","id":257219669,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257219669/movie480.mp4?t=1760809935","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257219669/movie_max.mp4?t=1760809935"},